  aciklama:
  - "Derin bir ma\u011Fara giri\u015Fini and\u0131ran telvelerinin \xF6n\xFC \"\xF6r\xFCmcek
    a\u011Flar\u0131yla\" kapanm\u0131\u015F Say\u0131n {{soyisim}}. \U0001F578\uFE0FBu
    \xF6r\xFCmcek a\u011Flar\u0131n\u0131n hemen arkas\u0131nda bir insan sil\xFCeti
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm manzara, adeta Sevr Ma\u011Faras\u0131'n\u0131
    an\u0131msat\u0131r nitelikte. \U0001F932Bu yans\u0131ma, ilahi g\xFC\xE7lerin
    seni koruyup kollad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n \xE7ok sarih bir delaleti {{isim}}.
    \xC7ok yak\u0131nda, yay\u0131lmac\u0131 bir huzurun \"tatl\u0131 egemenli\u011Fine\"
    kendini teslim edece\u011Fini hissediyorum. {{kelime, \u0130\xE7 \xE7ekerek \xF6zledi\u011Fin
    berekete kavu\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n | Etraf\u0131nda sana finansal a\xE7\u0131dan
    y\xFCk olan birinden kendini kurtaraca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n | \xC7ekti\u011Fin
    s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n neticesinde m\xFCkafatland\u0131r\u0131laca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n
    | \xC7ekti\u011Fin cefan\u0131n m\xFCkafat\u0131 olarak hayali kurdu\u011Fun
    ya\u015Fant\u0131ya kavu\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n}} m\xFCjdesini \u015Fimdiden
    verebilirim. B\u0131rak ruhun bu g\xFCvenceyle ferahlas\u0131n."
